  s0: A holds its place.R waits for an answer
  s1: A handed over to B.R waits for the handover news#59; R waits for an answer
  s2: A handed over to B.R accepts its answer#59; R waits for an answer
  s3: A handed over to B, B to C.R will never accept its answer#59; R waits for an answer
  s4: A handed over to B.R waits for the handover news#59; answer refused
  s5: A handed over to B.R accepts its answer#59; answer recorded
  s6: A handed over to B.R accepts its answer#59; answer refused
  s7: A handed over to B, B to C.R will never accept its answer#59; answer refused
  s8: A handed over to B, B to C.R will never accept its answer#59; answer recorded
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the person approves#59; M1 tells R's machine
  s1 --> s2: R's machine keeps the handover news
  s1 --> s3: B hands over to C#59; M1 has no reason to tell R's machine
  s1 --> s4: R refuses the answer
  s2 --> s3: B hands over to C#59; M1 has no reason to tell R's machine
  s3 --> s3: C answers R
  s4 --> s1: the sender sends the answer again, same id
  s4 --> s6: R's machine keeps the handover news
  s4 --> s7: B hands over to C#59; M1 has no reason to tell R's machine
  s2 --> s5: R records the answer
  s3 --> s7: R refuses the answer
  s5 --> s8: B hands over to C#59; M1 has no reason to tell R's machine
  s6 --> s2: the sender sends the answer again, same id
  s6 --> s7: B hands over to C#59; M1 has no reason to tell R's machine
  s7 --> s3: the sender sends the answer again, same id or C answers R
  s3 --> s8: R records the answer
